        "Both rods start at the same original length, 150 mm, and the new graph is a straight line because it obeys Hooke's law.",
        "At 90 kN the original compression is 2 mm, so the new compression is 3 mm and the new length is 147 mm.",
        "Draw a straight line from (0 kN, 150 mm) to (90 kN, 147 mm), below the original line."
